NAME
    uname - print system information

SYNOPSIS
    uname [OPTION]...

DESCRIPTION
    With no option prints the kernel name (same as -s).

    -a, --all            print everything
    -s, --kernel-name    kernel name
    -n, --nodename       host name (from /etc/hostname; see
                         'man hostname')
    -r, --kernel-release kernel release
    -v, --kernel-version kernel version
    -m, --machine        machine hardware name
    -p, --processor      processor type
    -i, --hardware-platform
    -o, --operating-system
        --help           show help and exit
        --version        show version and exit
